\left|\nabla p^y(t,x)-\nabla p^y(t,x')\right|\leqslant &c_1
\left[\left(t^{-1/\alpha(y)}|x-x'|\right)\wedge 1\right]\left(
\rho^{y,0}_{1-(1/\alpha(y))}(t,x)+\rho^{y,0}_{1-(1/\alpha(y))}(t,x')\right).
